1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
You've probably seen this message in your family group.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
A screenshot of a speech, one number, and a lie that looks true.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
The fact check comes, but by then it has been forwarded. Proof Card works the other way round.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Before the speech, we just enter the topic and the speaker.

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Gemini predicts the claims that are coming and checks each one with Google Search.

6
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:35,000
But the model never has the last word. We open every source page ourselves, find the exact line, and keep a hash of the page.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:42,000
No line, and the card says it plainly: not enough proof. No forced true or false.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Before the speech starts, {{BRIEF_N}} claims are ready, with sources.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Now live. The video plays in this tab, and Proof Card listens to this tab only.

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:04,000
The speaker says a claim from the brief... and the card is already there. PREBUNKED, in {{MATCH_MS}} milliseconds.

11
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Gemini transcribes, spots the claim and matches it to the brief with embeddings. Hindi, English and Hinglish.

12
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:22,000
And this new claim? It wasn't in the brief. It gets checked live: same path, same proof.

13
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:30,000
A verdict in {{COLD_S}} seconds, with the source line.

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,000
Now the real job. Every verdict is a Proof Card, with a QR and a fingerprint.

15
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:44,000
I share it on Telegram. My friend forwards it to our bot.

16
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:52,000
VERIFIED. Telegram compressed the image, and the card is still recognised. One tap opens the full proof.

17
00:01:52,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Now someone changes one word. Turns FALSE into TRUE, and forwards it on.

18
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:12,000
ALTERED. The bot shows what was changed, and the original card.

19
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:20,000
No login, on any phone. The proof travels with the forward.

20
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Built with Gemini on Vertex AI and Google Search grounding, on Cloud Run, Cloud Tasks, Firestore, Cloud Storage and Firebase.

21
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,000
On a 50 claim benchmark: accuracy {{ACC}}, prebunked cards in {{MATCH_MS}} ms, edits caught {{TAMPER}}.

22
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
Every number comes from a result file committed in the repo.

23
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:57,000
Proof Card. Know the claim before it's said.
